{"id":"652829","name":"凉拌紫茄","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/652829/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫茄","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"青辣椒","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茄子去掉两头洗净。","img":"images/652829/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"从中间剖开，切成长段。","img":"images/652829/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"装入盘中，放入蒸锅中蒸20分钟。","img":"images/652829/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"辣椒一分两半，切成长段。","img":"images/652829/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再切碎，放入盐码味。","img":"images/652829/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入豆豉和芝麻油拌匀。","img":"images/652829/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"茄子蒸熟以后端出。","img":"images/652829/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淋上做好的调料。","img":"images/652829/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"吃得时候拌匀即可。","img":"images/652829/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"茄子入口即化，香辣美味。","img":"images/652829/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}